Run the main.java 

The game is a text-based, playable RPG battle where you control a Player (your hero) who faces off against an Enemy (a goblin). In each round, you get to choose one of the following actions:

Attack: Your hero attacks the enemy using a sword.
Use Item: You can use a generic or named item, which (for demonstration) can slightly restore your health.
Run: Your hero can run to escape or reposition, which consumes stamina.

After your turn, if the enemy is still alive, it takes its turn to attack you. The game continues until either your hero or the enemy is defeated.

